---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { projects, site } from '../consts';
---

<Section id="projects" title="Projects">
  <p>
    The stack is independent projects on the same substrate. Each one solves its own problem and
    strengthens the primitives for all.
  </p>

  <ul>
    {
      projects.map((project) => (
        <li>
          <a href={project.href}>{project.name}</a>: {project.body}
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ul>

  <p>
    SSCCS is a paradigm, not a single implementation. The directory of all of them is at{' '}
    <a href={site.projects}>docs.ssccs.org/projects</a>.
  </p>
</Section>
